 is conformally flat, so its Weyl tensor vanishes, and $K = 2R_{\\mu\\nu}R^{\\mu\\nu}$ is the Ricci tensor's alone, where Schwarzschild's, whose Ricci tensor vanishes, is the Weyl tensor's alone."],"settings":"$m = GM/c^2 = 1$, the unit of every length, so that Schwarzschild's $r_s = 2m$.","clip":"We draw $K\\,m^4$ on a logarithmic scale from $10^{-4}$ to $10^{4}$ and cut each curve where it leaves the top of its panel, as $K$ does inside $r = 1.540\\,m$ and Schwarzschild's inside $r = 0.411\\,m$."},{"id":"dust","label":"Dust universe","system":"dust","kind":"line","x":{"name":"$ct/L$","from":-1,"to":1,"ticks":[{"at":-1.0,"label":"$-1$"},{"at":-0.5,"label":"$-0.5$"},{"at":0.0,"label":"$0$"},{"at":0.5,"label":"$0.5$"},{"at":1.0,"label":"$1$"}]},"panels":[{"id":"K","name":"$K\\,L^4$","aspect":2,"scale":{"kind":"log","from":1.0,"to":100000000.0},"ticks":[{"at":1.0,"label":"$10^{0}$"},{"at":100.0,"label":"$10^{2}$"},{"at":10000.0,"label":"$10^{4}$"},{"at":1000000.0,"label":"$10^{6}$"},{"at":100000000.0,"label":"$10^{8}$"}]},{"id":"R","name":"$R\\,L^2$","aspect":2,"scale":{"kind":"symlog","from":-10000.0,"to":0,"linear":1.0},"ticks":[{"at":-10000.0,"label":"$-10^{4}$"},{"at":-1000.0,"label":"$-10^{3}$"},{"at":-100.0,"label":"$-10^{2}$"},{"at":-10.0,"label":"$-10^{1}$"},{"at":0.0,"label":"$0$"}]}],"curves":[{"panel":"K","class":"K","metric":"nordstrom_scalar","system":"dust","scalar":"kretschmann","coordinate":"t","params":{"L":1.0},"points":[[-0.9405,10154224528.38118],[-0.931,3136375134.4683547],[-0.9205,1021535431.399872],[-0.915,601825168.9808047],[-0.909,351062094.2199192],[-0.9025,203629299.62037626],[-0.896,122405879.69700807],[-0.889,73275159.90467164],[-0.882,45289018.39911545],[-0.8745,27906176.03661555],[-0.867,17696338.09710136],[-0.859,11196909.546469666],[-0.8505,7082661.384542229],[-0.842,4598427.954080538],[-0.833,2985488.221087316],[-0.8235,1941009.7246492417],[-0.8140000000000001,1291850.8564587282],[-0.804,860959.4696712123],[-0.794,586031.16910708],[-0