legend":[["line","K","$K$, the Kretschmann scalar"],["line","R","$R$, the Ricci scalar"]],"caption":["The Kretschmann scalar $K$ and the Ricci scalar $R$ of Nordström's universe of dust against $ct$ ($L = 1$), the same at every $r$, $\\theta$, and $\\phi$. With the scale factor $\\Phi = 1 - c^2t^2/L^2$, $K = 48(8 - 12\\Phi + 5\\Phi^2)/L^4\\Phi^8$. It is the same at $t$ and $-t$, least at the greatest expansion, $t = 0$, where it is $48/L^4$, and grows without bound as $3L^4/2(L - |ct|)^8$ toward the bang at $ct = -L$ and the crunch at $ct = L$, where $\\Phi$ vanishes.","By Einstein and Fokker's field equation, $R = 24\\pi G\\,T/c^4 = -24\\pi G\\rho/c^2$, with $\\rho = \\rho_0/\\Phi^3$ the density of the dust, so $R = -12/L^2\\Phi^3$. It is negative at every $t$, nearest zero, $-12/L^2$, at $t = 0$, and grows without bound as $-3L/2(L - |ct|)^3$ toward the bang and the crunch."],"ricci_sentences":[[1,0],[1,1]],"per_scalar":{"kretschmann":{"opening":"The Kretschmann scalar $K$ of Nordström's universe of dust against $ct$ ($L = 1$), the same at every $r$, $\\theta$, and $\\phi$.","clip":"We draw $K\\,L^4$ on a logarithmic scale from $1$ to $10^{8}$ and cut each curve where it leaves its panel, as $K$ does for $|ct| > 0.893\\,L$.","legend":[["line","K","$K$, the Kretschmann scalar"]]},"ricci_scalar":{"opening":"The Ricci scalar $R$ of Nordström's universe of dust against $ct$ ($L = 1$), the same at every $r$, $\\theta$, and $\\phi$.","clip":"We draw $R\\,L^2$ on a signed logarithmic scale, linear within $1$ of zero, from $-10^{4}$ to $0$, and cut each curve where it leaves its panel, as $R$ does for $|ct| > 0.945\\,L$.","legend":[["line","R","$R$, the Ricci scalar"]]}},"settings":"$L = 1$, the unit of every length.","clip":"We draw $K\\,L^4$ on a logarithmic scale from $1$ to $10^{8}$ and $R\\,L^2$ on a signed logarithmic scale, linear within $1$ of zero, from $-10^{4}$ to $0$, and cut each curve where it leaves its panel, as $K$ does for $|ct| > 0.893\\,L$ and $R$ for $|ct| > 0.945\\,L$."}]}
